/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the collector's ancient artifacts, there seems to be a strange choice... video tapes! The tour guide insists they should never be touched, but why? Our protagonist Coby would rather not find out the secret of these videos, but it looks like he won't have a choice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678420/extras/c8e1fb96394ff5d1aa91cf64d339659d.avif?t=1766277631\" width=496 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and fates for the characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid taking damage from the strange paranormal surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moody music and spooky atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique randomization elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with many twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies such as shadow-ghosts and disembodied arms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro tile-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special limited-colour lighting effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animal characters with cartoony expressions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper and discover...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...there's more to the mansion than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678420/extras/9a7d99d9dd5abf5aea6030763cc10034.poster.avif?t=1766277631\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678420/extras/9a7d99d9dd5abf5aea6030763cc10034.webm?t=1766277631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.